{
  "name": "4gl-full",
  "displayName": "Genero BDL (4GL)",
  "description": "Genero BDL（.4gl）与 Form（.per）的完整语言支持：语法高亮、定义/引用跳转、符号大纲、悬停、语法诊断。",
  "version": "0.6.1",
  "publisher": "darcyjoven",
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.91.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Programming Languages",
    "Linters"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "genero",
    "bdl",
    "4gl",
    "per",
    "form",
    "fgl"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/darcyjoven/vscode-bdl.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/darcyjoven/vscode-bdl/issues"
  },
  "activationEvents": [
    "onLanguage:bdl",
    "onLanguage:per",
    "onCommand:bdl.forceParseCurrentFile",
    "onCommand:bdl.migrateLinkDir",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.importCsv",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.syncCurrent",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.syncModules",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.syncAll",
    "onCommand:bdl.link.status",
    "onCommand:bdl.links.resync",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.import",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.refresh",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.filter",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.clearFilter",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.syncTable",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.copyColumn",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.openTable",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.syncAll",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.syncSelected",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.selectAll",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.clearSelection",
    "onCommand:bdl.schema.syncFiltered"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "languages": [
      {
        "id": "bdl",
        "aliases": [
          "Genero BDL",
          "bdl",
          "4gl"
        ],
        "extensions": [
          ".4gl",
          ".global"
        ],
        "configuration": "./language-configuration/bdl.json"
      },
      {
        "id": "per",
        "aliases": [
          "Genero Form",
          "per"
        ],
        "extensions": [
          ".per"
        ],
        "configuration": "./language-configuration/per.json"
      }
    ],
    "grammars": [
      {
        "language": "bdl",
        "scopeName": "source.4gl",
        "path": "./syntaxes/bdl.tmLanguage.json"
      },
      {
        "language": "per",
        "scopeName": "source.per",
        "path": "./syntaxes/per.tmLanguage.json"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": [
      {
        "title": "基础",
        "order": 0,
        "properties": {
          "bdl.server.path": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "machine-overridable",
            "markdownDescription": "`bdl-lsp` 可执行文件路径（文件或所在目录）。留空时依次查找：环境变量 `BDL_LSP_PATH`、扩展内置 `bin/`、工作区 `.bdl-lsp/bin/bdl-lsp`、系统 `PATH`。修改后需重启语言服务器。\n\n平台安装包已内置语言服务器，通常不需要设置此项。"
          },
          "bdl.tools.path": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "markdownDescription": "`tiptop` 可执行文件的路径（可填文件或所在目录）。tiptop 负责采集链接资料与部署，从语言服务器分离而来。留空时按以下顺序查找：环境变量 `TIPTOP_PATH` → 扩展内置 `bin/tiptop` → 工作区 `.bdl-lsp/bin/tiptop` → 系统 `PATH`。"
          },
          "bdl.server.logLevel": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "error",
              "warn",
              "info",
              "debug"
            ],
            "default": "info",
            "scope": "machine-overridable",
            "markdownDescription": "语言服务器日志级别。日志同时写入扩展日志目录。修改后需重启语言服务器。"
          },
          "bdl.trace.server": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "off",
              "messages",
              "verbose"
            ],
            "default": "off",
            "description": "记录客户端与语言服务器之间的 LSP 消息（输出到「Genero BDL 追踪」通道）。"
          },
          "bdl.generoVersion": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "2.50",
              "3.00",
              "4.00"
            ],
            "default": "2.50",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "目标 Genero 版本。当前语法基线为 **2.50**；更高版本的差异尚未实现。"
          },
          "bdl.diagnostics": {
            "type": "object",
            "default": {},
            "scope": "window",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "off",
                "error",
                "warning",
                "information",
                "hint"
              ]
            },
            "markdownDescription": "诊断级别的唯一入口：按诊断码覆盖。键为诊断码，值为 `off`/`error`/`warning`/`information`/`hint`；未列出的码使用默认级别（除 `record-member-unknown` 默认 off、`link-data-stale` 默认 hint、`file-too-large` 默认 information 外，其余默认 warning）。\n\n可用诊断码：`syntax-error`、`missing-node`（MISSING 整簇，也可精确到 `missing-<kind>`）、`globals-file-not-found`、`variable-source-unresolved`、`field-not-in-form`、`form-duplicate-item`、`form-layout-tag-undefined`、`form-screen-record-undefined`、`record-member-unknown`、`file-too-large`、`function-not-found`、`link-data-invalid`、`link-data-stale`。\n\n示例：\n```jsonc\n\"bdl.diagnostics\": {\n  \"variable-source-unresolved\": \"warning\",\n  \"record-member-unknown\": \"off\",\n  \"syntax-error\": \"error\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "bdl.format.keywords": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "unchanged",
              "upper",
              "lower"
            ],
            "default": "unchanged",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "格式化时关键字的大小写处理：`unchanged` 保持不变、`upper` 转大写、`lower` 转小写。\n\n仅改写关键字本身，不动空白、标点与换行；含语法错误的文件整体跳过格式化。"
          },
          "bdl.format.indentStyle": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "tab",
              "space"
            ],
            "default": "auto",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "格式化时的缩进字符：`auto` 跟随编辑器 `editor.insertSpaces` 设置、`tab` 强制制表符、`space` 强制空格。"
          },
          "bdl.format.indentSize": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 0,
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 16,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "每级缩进的宽度（`indentStyle` 为 `space` 时的空格数，为 `tab` 时仅影响显示宽度）。`0` 表示跟随编辑器 `editor.tabSize`。"
          },
          "bdl.index.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "在工作区后台建立符号索引（全工作区符号搜索、跨文件跳转与引用的基础）。关闭后这些功能只覆盖已打开的文件。"
          },
          "bdl.globals.searchPaths": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "GLOBALS 文件路径的附加解析根（相对工作区根，按序尝试）。适用于引用写法按引用文件目录解析不到、但文件在工作区其他位置的场景（如各模块目录层级不一致的 `../../config/top.global`）。"
          },
          "bdl.perRoots": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "`.per` 表单文件的附加查找根（相对工作区根，按序尝试）。表单路径先按 `4gl 同级 per 目录` 解析，失败后尝试这些根，最后按 basename 在工作区内唯一匹配。"
          },
          "bdl.builtins.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "是否启用内置符号表（Genero 自带的变量/函数/类名）。\n\n关闭后 `STATUS`/`SQLCA`/`INT_FLAG`/`fgl_*`/`ui.*` 等名字会重新报“无法确定变量来源”（即 P7-C 之前的行为），一般不需要关。"
          },
          "bdl.builtins.paths": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "额外的内置符号覆盖文件或目录（相对工作区根，按序加载，后者覆盖前者；目录里所有 `*.json` 都会加载）。\n\n项目约定路径 `.bdl-lsp/builtins.json` 会自动加载，不需要写在这里。"
          },
          "bdl.builtins.disable": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "关闭指定的内置名（大小写不敏感），优先级高于任何覆盖文件。\n\n典型用途：项目里自己定义了同名函数，不想被内置表“吞掉”。\n\n示例：`[\"SUM\", \"LENGTH\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.ignore.files": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "整文件忽略诊断的 glob（工作区相对路径，`**` 跨目录；不含 `/` 的模式也按文件名匹配）。命中的文件不发布任何诊断，也不进入工作区符号索引。\n\n例：`[\"build/**\", \"**/*.bak.4gl\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.ignore.fields": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "忽略 `field-not-in-form` 的字段名 glob（大小写不敏感）。\n\n例：`[\"tmp_*\", \"legacy.field\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.ignore.forms": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "忽略某张表单的全部字段类诊断的 glob（匹配表单字面量、文件名或相对路径，大小写不敏感）。\n\n例：`[\"cust\", \"**/per/old.per\"]`"
          },
          "bdl.limits.maxFileBytes": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 2097152,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "超过该字节数的文件不做语法诊断（仍可高亮与跳转）。"
          },
          "bdl.limits.maxFileLines": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 20000,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "超过该行数的文件不做语法诊断。"
          },
          "bdl.limits.maxIssues": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 200,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "单个文件最多报告的诊断条数，防止极端文件刷屏。"
          },
          "bdl.limits.parseTimeoutMs": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 2000,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "单次解析的超时时间（毫秒）。超时后保留上一次诊断。"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "生产环境",
        "properties": {
          "bdl.prod.oracle.host": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "Oracle 主机（`source=golang` 采集链接资料时用）。\n\n**只写在 Workspace 设置里**，并且**不要让 `settings.json` 进 git 管理**。\n\n密码**不在这里**：用环境变量 `BDL_ORA_PASSWORD`，或项目里的 `.project/secrets.json`（chmod 600）。\n\n填好后即可在命令面板用「Genero BDL: 链接资料：…」系列命令从 VSCode 里采集。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.oracle.port": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 1521,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "Oracle 端口，默认 1521。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.oracle.service": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "Oracle service name（如 `PROD`）。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.oracle.user": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "只读账号（只查 `DS.GAL_FILE`）。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.host": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "部署目标主机（SSH）。\n\n**只写在 Workspace 设置里**，并且**不要让 `settings.json`（工作区的或 `~/.vscode/settings.json`）进 git 管理**。\n\n密码/密钥**不放在设置里**：Oracle 密码用环境变量 `BDL_ORA_PASSWORD` 或 `<项目>/.project/secrets.json`（chmod 600）；SSH 用密钥文件或 ssh-agent。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.port": {
            "type": "number",
            "default": 22,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "SSH 端口，默认 22。（只写 Workspace 设置；别把 `settings.json` 提交到 git）"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.user": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "SSH 用户名（建议用密钥登录）。（只写 Workspace 设置；别把 `settings.json` 提交到 git）"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.remoteRoot": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "远程工作根目录（POSIX 绝对路径，如 `/home/apps/tiptop`）。（只写 Workspace 设置；别把 `settings.json` 提交到 git）"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.localRoot": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": ".",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "本地根目录（相对工作区根），默认 `.`。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.transport": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "rsync",
              "scp"
            ],
            "default": "rsync",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "首选传输方式：`rsync`（默认）或 `scp`。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.fallback": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "scp",
              "none"
            ],
            "default": "scp",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "首选方式失败后的回退：`scp`（默认）或 `none`（不回退）。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.delete": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "rsync 是否加 `--delete`。**默认关闭**：远程目录常混有编译产物，误删代价高。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.include": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "上传包含的 glob（相对本地根）。留空 = tiptop 默认（`4gl`/`per`）。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.exclude": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "上传排除的 glob（优先于 include）。留空 = tiptop 默认。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.strictHostKey": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "严格校验 SSH host key（默认开）。只有在受控内网且你清楚风险时才关。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.compile4gl": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "远程编译 `.4gl` 的命令模板。留空 = tiptop 默认（`fglcomp`）。可用 `${file}`/`${dir}` 占位。"
          },
          "bdl.prod.deploy.compilePer": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "远程编译 `.per` 的命令模板。留空 = tiptop 默认（`fglform`）。"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "链接资料",
        "order": 1,
        "properties": {
          "bdl.link.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "跨模块函数可见性、侧边栏「链接资料」视图、反查引用程序。\n\n**默认关闭**（轻量档：零配置、不连库、不后台跑任务、不往项目里写文件）。需要时打开，并二选一准备资料：\n1. 直连 Oracle 采集：填「生产环境」的连接信息，再用命令 `Genero BDL: 链接资料：全量更新`；\n2. 用 DS.GAL_FILE 导出：命令 `Genero BDL: 链接资料：从 CSV 导入`。\n\n资料落在 `<项目>/.project/`（迁移前的 `.link/` 仍兼容读取）。"
          },
          "bdl.link.dataDir": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": ".project",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "项目资料目录（相对工作区根），默认 `.project`：里面是 `links.jsonl`、`links.meta.json`、`gal_file.csv`、`secrets.json`，由 `tiptop link import`/`sync` 生成（迁移前放在 `.link/`，仍兼容读取）。"
          },
          "bdl.link.moduleRoots": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "模组根目录（相对工作区根，如 `tiptop`、`topcust`）。\n\n留空自动探测：凡是「子目录里还有一层含 `4gl/` 的目录」的顶层目录都算模组根，`tiptop` 优先。"
          },
          "bdl.link.globalModules": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [
              "sub",
              "lib",
              "qry"
            ],
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "对所有程序可见的模组（扁平规则：这些模组里的函数任何程序都能调，包括它们自己）。\n\n把公共库放在别的模组时改这里。"
          }
        },
        "description": "链接资料（程序与 4GL 文件的链接关系）。资料由 tiptop 生成：`tiptop link import -csv <导出.csv>` 或 `tiptop link sync`；语言服务器只读取它。"
      },
      {
        "title": "部署",
        "order": 2,
        "properties": {
          "bdl.deploy.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "上传源码到远程服务器并远程编译。\n\n**默认关闭**。打开后命令面板才出现部署命令。部署配置不用手写 JSON：插件会把「生产环境 → 部署」里的设置合成为 `<项目>/.project/deploy.json` 再交给 tiptop。"
          },
          "bdl.deploy.target": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "部署目标名（插件生成的 `.project/deploy.json` 里的 `targets` 键）。留空则用 `defaultTarget`。"
          }
        },
        "description": "部署（上传源码到远程服务器并远程编译）。由 tiptop 执行，命令为 `tiptop deploy`。配置见工作区 `.bdl-lsp/deploy.json`。"
      },
      {
        "title": "数据库字段",
        "properties": {
          "bdl.schema.enable": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "scope": "window",
            "description": "读取项目里的数据库字段资料（`.project/.schema`，由 tiptop schema import 生成）",
            "markdownDescription": "读取项目里的**数据库字段资料**（`.project/.schema`），用于三件事：\n\n1. `DEFINE r RECORD LIKE t.*` 的成员校验（配合 `record-member-unknown`）；\n2. 悬停 `LIKE t.col` / `LIKE t.*` 时显示字段类型与中文说明；\n3. `r.` 补全带上列的类型与说明。\n\n**默认关闭**（轻量档）。资料由 `tiptop schema import -csv <Oracle导出.csv>` 生成，或命令面板 `Genero BDL: 数据库字段：` 系列命令。"
          },
          "bdl.schema.dataDir": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": ".project/.schema",
            "scope": "window",
            "markdownDescription": "字段资料目录（相对工作区根，默认 `.project/.schema`）：`tables.json` 是总索引，`tables/<表>.json` 是每张表的列。由 `tiptop schema import` 生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "configurationDefaults": {
      "[bdl]": {
        "editor.defaultFormatter": "darcyjoven.4gl-full"
      }
    },
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "bdl.restartServer",
        "title": "重启语言服务器",
